@startuml kairos-department-reports-sequence
title View Department Reports

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Department Reports
WebAdmin -> API: GET /departments/{id}/reports
API -> DB: Aggregate attendance %, active members,\nmissing lists, follow-up reminders
DB --> API: Aggregated metrics
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {metrics}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Render charts and tables

@enduml
